3px&quot;&gt;Azure AI Search (shared, S1, 2 replicas)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;one index per client, push only&lt;br&gt;index-scoped RBAC: each app can&lt;br&gt;read/write only its own index&lt;br&gt;no indexers (they bypass index RBAC)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c0392b;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="745" y="917" width="316" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c74" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/app_services/Search_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1037" y="922" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c75" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Key Vault (cell)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;TLS certificates for client host&lt;br&gt;names only; read by id-cell-agw&lt;br&gt;no client secrets here&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1076" y="917" width="316" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c76" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/security/Key_Vaults.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1368" y="922" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c77" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Log Analytics (cell)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;App Gateway, WAF, APIM and&lt;br&gt;environment logs; no prompt bodies;&lt;br&gt;platform ops group only&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1407" y="917" width="316" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c78" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/analytics/Log_Analytics_Workspaces.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1699" y="922" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c79" value="Deployed by id-deploy-cell01 (shared RG + per-client wiring). It holds no role on any client&#x27;s data." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#5b6675;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="745" y="1025" width="678" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s78" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=24;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3e6;strokeColor=#b7791f;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1755" y="167" width="700" height="304" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c81" value="rg-northwind-prd-eus2" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b7791f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1769" y="175" width="206" height="23" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c82" value="per client: client data, keys, models; deployed by id-deploy-northwind" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#5b6675;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1769" y="199" width="476" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c83" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Azure OpenAI (northwind&amp;#x27;s own account)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;DataZoneStandard; capacity carved&lt;br&gt;from the cell&amp;#x27;s regional quota&lt;br&gt;trusts only id-northwind-gw&lt;/span&gt;" style="roun